{
  // PvE-specific corrections.
  //
  // S1 (patch 1.1.0.0) trader-loyalty requirements + renames, ported from the
  // s1 branch and re-expressed in the refactor branch's discriminated syntax.
  //
  // The refactor/modes-contract-and-audit-tooling branch dropped the s1 batch
  // (LL1-LL4 trader requirements replacing minPlayerLevel, quest renames, XP
  // reworks) claiming the API no longer carries those divergences. Verified
  // against json.tarkov.dev/pve/tasks on 2026-08-15: the API serves none of
  // these level requirements for 186 quests (overrides are load-bearing), and
  // serves a matching requirement for 59 more (harmless no-op under
  // replace-array semantics). Two quests differ from the API value: Punisher
  // Part 2 and Huntsman Path - Controller carry LL4 here per the s1 capture
  // while the API serves LL3 (6a70899e66497c811decb758 / 6a71c5b3fdd890dfd2f2c34d).
  //
  // Power of Persuasion / Easy-Breezy / Setup keep only their name and/or
  // traderRequirements here: the PvE variant objectives are already served
  // correctly by the API (the PvP variants live in modes/regular/tasks.json5).
  // Small Business Part 3 (LL4 Skier) is now served upstream and retained as
  // a no-op. Pathfinder's rename is retained; the "Survive and extract on
  // Interchange 7 times" objective rewrite is ported as-is from s1.
  //
  // Entries below are ACTIVE corrections; `npm run check-overrides` verifies
  // them against the live API.

